Description: NoobWRT (21.02 port) - clean sidebar theme with a quick-access toolbar.
 Port of luci-theme-noobwrt 1.1.7 (nooblk-98, Apache-2.0) to OpenWrt 21.02
 Lua templates. Light or dark (follows the browser, switch in the toolbar).
 Registers luci.themes.NoobWRT21; it does not change the active theme.
